# 1. Install the "REST Client" extension (by Huachao Mao) or "Thunder Client" in your IDE.
# 2. Click "Send Request" directly above any request to execute it in real-time.
# 3. Variables like @authToken are automatically captured and passed to all subsequent calls!

@baseUrl = https://digifields-360.onrender.com
@instanceUrl = https://orgfarm-4036b01401-dev-ed.develop.my.salesforce.com
@username = piyush.channe.3868c7575da5@agentforce.com
@password = YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & PROFILE (Screens 01, 02, 23)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 Health Check & API Discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2 Live Salesforce Login (Returns Real 00D Salesforce Access Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Automatically capture real live Salesforce token and technician ID from login response:
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@technicianId = {{login.response.body.technician.id}}

### 1.3 Wrong Password Test (Verifies 401 Unauthorized Rejection)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "WRONG_PASSWORD_999"
}

### 1.4 Get Authenticated Technician Profile (Screen 23)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/technician/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.5 Get Full User Details & Shift Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/details
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. SHIFT MORNING SYNC & DASHBOARD (Screens 03, 04)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 Morning Pre-Load Sync (Shift Start / SQLite Cache)
# @name morningSync
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/morning-payload?technicianId={{technicianId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.2 Technician Dashboard Summary (Screen 04)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.3 Sync Engine Status (Screen 03)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. JOBS & WORK ORDERS LIFECYCLE (Screens 05, 06, 07)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 List Assigned Work Orders (Screen 05)
# @name listWorkOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Extract first Work Order ID dynamically:
@workOrderId = {{listWorkOrders.response.body.workOrders[0].Id}}

### 3.2 Get Work Order Detail & Equipment History (Screen 06)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.3 Transition Status: En Route (Screen 07)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "En Route",
  "operationId": "OP-STATUS-001"
}

### 3.4 Transition Status: On Site (Screen 07)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "On Site",
  "operationId": "OP-STATUS-002"
}

### 3.5 Transition Status: In Progress (Screen 07)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress",
  "operationId": "OP-STATUS-003"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. GPS GEOFENCING & TELEMETRY (Screens 08, 09)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4.1 GPS Check-In with Geofence Distance Calculation (Screen 08)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{workOrderId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 18.520430,
  "longitude": 73.856743,
  "accuracy": 5.0,
  "overrideReason": null
}

### 4.2 Batch GPS Telemetry Tracking (Screen 09)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gps/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "DEVICE-TECH-001",
  "positions": [
    {
      "latitude": 18.520430,
      "longitude": 73.856743,
      "accuracy": 8,
      "speed": 32.5,
      "timestamp": "2026-09-02T10:15:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. ACTIVITY LOG & LABOR TRACKING (Screen 10)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5.1 Get Activities for Job (Screen 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{workOrderId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5.2 Log Labor Time & Activity (Screen 10)
# @name logActivity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{workOrderId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Repair",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "notes": "Replaced faulty temperature sensor TS-40 and flushed coolant line.",
  "partsUsed": "Temp Sensor TS-40 (1x), Coolant 5L"
}

@activityId = {{logActivity.response.body.activityId}}

