### 14. DIRECT REAL-TIME SALESFORCE SOBJECT APIS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 14.1 Query Work Orders from Salesforce
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data/Work_Order__c?fields=Id,Name,Subject__c,Status__c,Priority__c&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14.2 Query Accounts from Salesforce
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/data/Account?fields=Id,Name,BillingCity,AnnualRevenue&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14.3 Direct SOQL Query against Salesforce Org
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/data/query
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "soql": "SELECT Id, Name, Skills__c, First_Time_Fix_Rate__c, Is_Active__c FROM Technician__c LIMIT 5"
}

